# Markdown that grows with you

:::::box{class=lede}
Every HyMarkX document is a Markdown document. It stays one until the day you need a
component, a value, or a button — and then it is still the same file.
:::::

:::::box{class=cta}
`npm install hymarkx` [read the docs](https://github.com/NAME0x0/HyMarkX/tree/main/docs/guides) [browse the source](https://github.com/NAME0x0/HyMarkX)
:::::

::::::

